Package: waterQualSDM
Type: Package
Title: Water Quality Modeling in Agricultural Watersheds
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Zahra", "OUCHEN",
      email = "zahra.ouchen@iav.ac.ma",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: A package for analyzing and modeling soil quality in agricultural 
    watersheds in Morocco, with a focus on Soil Organic Carbon (SOC) prediction 
    using Random Forest and spatial vulnerability mapping. Uses real environmental 
    data from SoilGrids, ESA World Cover, SRTM and WorldClim.
